<title>USA: Omaha cattle about steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle about steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said slaughter steers and heifers sold about steady.</p>
<p>Steers - largely choice 2-4 1100-1300 lbs 66.50-68.00, load 68.50. Select 60.00-66.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - select to mainly choice 2-4 1000-1200 lbs 65.50-68.00. Select 60.00-65.00.</p>
</text>
